 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.24,
   "text": "You have the file. You just need it... as something else."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 4.8,
   "e": 14.16,
   "text": "So you find a converter website. Upload it to a stranger's server. Wait. Download. Or install one more app, for one more format."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 14.8,
   "e": 15.84,
   "text": "Meet Clementine."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 16.24,
   "e": 22.16,
   "text": "Hold Shift as you drag a file... and every format it can become blooms open, right under your cursor."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 22.56,
   "e": 25.76,
   "text": "Drop it. And the new file lands right beside the original."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 26.16,
   "e": 32.8,
   "text": "Photos. Video. Audio. Documents. PDFs. Archives. One gesture, for all of it."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 33.28,
   "e": 44.4,
   "text": "Add Option, and the wheel fills with tools. Compress. Crop. Redact. Annotate. Trim on a real waveform. Bleep a word. Rearrange pages. Merge PDFs."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 44.72,
   "e": 48.72,
   "text": "And all of it happens on your Mac. Nothing is uploaded. Ever."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 49.2,
   "e": 53.76,
   "text": "Clementine. Free, for your Mac. Just hold Shift... and drag."
  }
 ]
}